{"id":"3f578666c473032f","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system.md","title":"ZFC Countable Support Iteration System","display":"df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system — ZFC Countable Support Iteration System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system"],"display":"df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system — ZFC Countable Support Iteration System","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system — ZFC Countable Support Iteration System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf 1 \\in V\">\\(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf 1 \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S \\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S \\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}system}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists P,Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\vec{\\mathbb P}=\\langle P,Q\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,\\delta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(P))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(Q))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf1,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf1))\n\\land P(0)=\\{\\emptyset\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Star},\n\\{\\langle P(\\alpha),Q(\\alpha)\\rangle:\\alpha\\in\\delta\\},\n\\operatorname{ran}(P)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\nP(\\alpha+1)=\\operatorname{Star}(\\langle P(\\alpha),Q(\\alpha)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Supp},\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(P),\\mathcal P(\\delta)\\right)\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(P)\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\operatorname{dom}(p),\\operatorname{ran}(p))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\delta\\land\n\\operatorname{Supp}(p)=\n\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p):p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta+1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\nP(\\lambda)=\\{p\\in V:\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(p))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(p\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\in P(\\alpha))\n\\land|\\{\\alpha\\in\\lambda:p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}|\\leq\\omega\\}\\Bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}system}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists P,Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\vec{\\mathbb P}=\\langle P,Q\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,\\delta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(P))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(Q))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf1,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf1))\n\\land P(0)=\\{\\emptyset\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Star},\n\\{\\langle P(\\alpha),Q(\\alpha)\\rangle:\\alpha\\in\\delta\\},\n\\operatorname{ran}(P)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\nP(\\alpha+1)=\\operatorname{Star}(\\langle P(\\alpha),Q(\\alpha)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Supp},\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(P),\\mathcal P(\\delta)\\right)\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(P)\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\operatorname{dom}(p),\\operatorname{ran}(p))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\delta\\land\n\\operatorname{Supp}(p)=\n\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p):p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta+1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\nP(\\lambda)=\\{p\\in V:\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(p))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(p\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\in P(\\alpha))\n\\land|\\{\\alpha\\in\\lambda:p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}|\\leq\\omega\\}\\Bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Star}\">\\(\\operatorname{Star}\\)</span> is the explicit successor-stage forcing constructor, while <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1\">\\(\\mathbf1\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Supp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Supp}\\)</span> expose the coordinate units and support map.</li>\n<li>Countable support is a limit-stage clause of an iteration; it does not by itself define the iteration system.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf 1 \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S \\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}system}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists P,Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\vec{\\mathbb P}=\\langle P,Q\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,\\delta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(P))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(Q))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathbf1,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf1))\n\\land P(0)=\\{\\emptyset\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Star},\n\\{\\langle P(\\alpha),Q(\\alpha)\\rangle:\\alpha\\in\\delta\\},\n\\operatorname{ran}(P)\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\nP(\\alpha+1)=\\operatorname{Star}(\\langle P(\\alpha),Q(\\alpha)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Supp},\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(P),\\mathcal P(\\delta)\\right)\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(P)\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\operatorname{dom}(p),\\operatorname{ran}(p))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)\\subseteq\\delta\\land\n\\operatorname{Supp}(p)=\n\\{\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{dom}(p):p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta+1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\nP(\\lambda)=\\{p\\in V:\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(p))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(p\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\in P(\\alpha))\n\\land|\\{\\alpha\\in\\lambda:p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbf1(\\alpha)\\}|\\leq\\omega\\}\\Bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Star}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Supp}","display":false}],"bytes":2489,"backlinks":[{"id":"4f78f02a1aad45dd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system]])"},{"id":"c4cf60dd2d7b3e60","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"496cf1f6601b47fe","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id